  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "おうの　あくじを　もっかんに　しるししょばつされた　ひとの　うらみがかれはを　まとい　ポケモンとなった。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "왕의 악행을 목간에 기록했다는 이유로 처벌을 받은 사람의 원한이 마른 잎을 두르고 포켓몬이 되었다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "將王所行之惡事記於木簡而遭懲罰者的恨意裹上了枯落的葉子，變成了寶可夢。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "La rancœur d’un être humain puni pour avoir noté les méfaits d’un roi sur des tablettes en bois s’est mêlée à des feuilles mortes et a pris vie.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Der Groll einer Person, die dafür bestraft wurde, die Missetaten des Königs auf Tafeln festzuhalten, hüllte sich in Laub und wurde zu diesem Pokémon.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Este Pokémon nació al imbuirse en hojas marchitas el rencor de una persona castigada por enumerar las fechorías de su rey en unas tablillas.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Prese vita quando delle foglie secche si unirono all’astio di una persona punita per aver scritto le malefatte di un re su delle tavolette di legno.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "The grudge of a person punished for writing the king’s evil deeds upon wooden tablets has clad itself in dead leaves to become a Pokémon.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "王の　悪事を　木簡に　記し処罰された　人の　恨みが枯葉を　まとい　ポケモンとなった。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "有人曾把王的恶行记于木简而因此遭到了处罚，其恨意裹上了枯叶，变成了宝可梦。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Este Pokémon nació al imbuirse en hojas marchitas el rencor de una persona castigada por enumerar las fechorías de su rey en unas tablillas.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "くさきの　エネルギーを　すいあげる。しゅういの　もりは　たちどころに　かれはてたはたは　ふさくとなる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "초목의 에너지를 흡수한다. 주위의 숲은 금세 말라비틀어지며 논밭에는 흉작이 들게 된다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "會吸取草木的能量，使周圍的森林霎時乾枯，田地的農作物歉收。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il absorbe l’énergie de la végétation, ce qui a pour effet de dessécher instantanément les forêts alentour et de rendre les champs infertiles.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es entzieht der Vegetation Energie, sodass umliegende Wälder auf der Stelle verdorren und Felder unfruchtbar werden.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Absorbe la energía de la vegetación, lo que hace que los bosques cercanos se marchiten a su paso y que la tierra de los campos se vuelva estéril.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Riesce ad assorbire l’energia vitale della vegetazione, facendo seccare all’istante i boschi e rendendo sterili i campi.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It drains the life-force from vegetation, causing nearby forests to instantly wither and fields to turn barren.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "草木の　エネルギーを　吸い上げる。周囲の　森は　たちどころに　枯れ果て田畑は　不作となる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
